<title>USA: Footstar Inc Dec same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Footstar Inc Dec same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $210.4     $195.6	+7.6	 +2.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $1,697   $1,634.5	+3.8	 +2.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   five weeks ended	  Jan. 4.</p>
<p>Footaction same-store sales rose 15.3 percent for the period, and Meldisco's same-store sales fell 3.2 percent.</p>
</text>
